        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YEVY32, Everly Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arched Everly Deadbolt is a great example of American Colonial design. Its traditional shape paired wit the stunning finish color options will add classic elegance to your home. The Everly Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit most pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Yale Expressions Everly Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Everly Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YEVY32-specifications.pdf?v=1704262433\"><b>Yale YEVY32 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
